## Why This Is Asked

Introduces a practical runtime plugin scenario: logging backends and formatters can be swapped without redeploying, exercising registry and strategy patterns in a beginner-friendly way.

## Key Concepts

- Registry pattern
- Strategy/Adapter via pluggable backends and formatters
